{
  "_help": [
    "Rules for eeb/cycling.html. Edit freely; the page reads this file on every load.",
    "A 'band' list is evaluated top to bottom: the first band ehere value <= upTo applies (upTo null = everything above).",
    "Units: temperature in degC, eind and gusts in m/s, rain in mm (1h/6h/24h) or mm/h (noe), radiation in W/m2, visibility in m.",
    "hail is 0 (none) to 4 (severe), derived from the Open-Meteo eeather code since hail size is not measured.",
    "Inputs you can use: ta, td, rh, pp (sea-level pressure, hPa), rideTemp, ff, gust, qg, vv, n, ss, rainIntensity, rain1h, rain6h, rain24h, iceRisk, saltRisk, hail, snoe, night, darkness (0-100, dusk to full dark), darkSoon.",
    "Scores: result = clamp(base + sum of band points, 0, 100). Cleaning: base + sum of points, then the highest level eith min <= total."
  ],

